00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:27.440
Any time you use a Google Cloud
client library in Python 2,

00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:30.230
you need a pair of third
party helper libraries.

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:32.570
Fortunately, they're already
