00:07:17.155 --> 00:07:18.780
WESLEY CHUN: The
answer is yes, Martin.

00:07:18.780 --> 00:07:20.550
But there is a catch.

00:07:20.550 --> 00:07:23.610
You have to migrate
from 2.5 to 2.7

00:07:23.610 --> 00:07:27.690
and DB to NDB first before
applying the migration we just

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:28.740
discussed.

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:32.310
Check out these Python 2.5
DB docs as well as the NDB

00:07:32.310 --> 00:07:35.170
migration guide to get started.

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:36.340
MARTIN: That's great.

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:38.518
Are there docs for NDB too?

00:07:38.518 --> 00:07:40.810
WESLEY CHUN: Well, here are
